<title>USA: Broad National sets special 10 stock div.</title>
<headline>Broad National sets special 10 stock div.</headline>
<dateline>NEWARK, N.J. 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Broad National Bancorporation said on Friday it declared a special 10 percent common stock dividend in addition to its regular $0.07 per share quarterly cash dividend.</p>
<p>Chairman and Chief Executive Officer Donald Karp said in a statement that the stock dividend would be distributed on October 4 to shareholders of record at the close of business on October 3.</p>
